rule first_band_rows_together v1
description "A band a policy first table writes from the kind of an order and its amount, read with the amount alone: under 46 yen, goods are small and services medium, so the two rows take every order under 46 yen before the last row can write large, and no row is asked for large under 46 yen"

enum choice = one | two
enum order_kind = goods | service
enum size = small | medium | large

inputs
  amount : money[JPY]  range >=1JPY <=90JPY
  kind   : order_kind

outputs
  x : choice

table band_of
policy first
| amount | kind    | -> band : size |
| <46JPY | goods   | small          |
| <46JPY | service | medium         |
| -      | -       | large          |

table pick
| amount  | band   | -> x |
| <46JPY  | small  | one  |
| <46JPY  | medium | two  |
| >=46JPY | large  | one  |
